{"game":{"display_name":"準々決勝 - 第 1 試合","duration_seconds":900,"game_id":8,"game_type":"1v1","is_public":true,"main_players":[{"display_name":"kagaffy","icon_path":"files/img/kagaffy/icon.jpg","is_admin":false,"label":"ベスト4","user_id":13,"username":"kagaffy"},{"display_name":"KeisukeSakata","icon_path":"files/img/KeisukeSakata/icon.png","is_admin":false,"label":"ベスト6","user_id":17,"username":"KeisukeSakata"}],"problem":{"description":"『99 Bottles of Beer』の歌詞を 99 本から 0 本まで出力してください。\r\n歌詞の内容は「99 Bottles of Beer」で検索するか、サンプルコードを参照してください。\r\nそれぞれの節の間には空行を挿入してください。","language":"swift","problem_id":5,"sample_code":"func bottleCountText(_ count: Int) -> String {\r\n    switch count {\r\n    case 0:\r\n        return \"no more bottles\"\r\n    case 1:\r\n        return \"1 bottle\"\r\n    default:\r\n        return \"\\(count) bottles\"\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunc printVerse(startingBottles: Int) {\r\n    let currentBottles = bottleCountText(startingBottles)\r\n    let nextBottles = bottleCountText(startingBottles - 1)\r\n    \r\n    let firstLine = \"\\(currentBottles.prefix(1).uppercased())\\(currentBottles.dropFirst()) of beer on the wall, \\(currentBottles) of beer.\"\r\n    \r\n    if startingBottles > 0 {\r\n        print(firstLine)\r\n        print(\"Take one down and pass it around, \\(nextBottles) of beer on the wall.\")\r\n    } else {\r\n        print(firstLine)\r\n        print(\"Go to the store and buy some more, 99 bottles of beer on the wall.\")\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\nfor bottleCount in (0...99).reversed() {\r\n    printVerse(startingBottles: bottleCount)\r\n    if bottleCount > 0 {\r\n        print()\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n","title":"99 Bottles of Beer","sample_code_html":"<pre class=\"shiki github-light\" style=\"background-color:#fff;color:#24292e\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1\"> bottleCountText</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1\">_</span><span sty